# Consecrated Sphinx under Spirit of the Labyrinth: "if an effect offers the player a choice to draw multiple cards, the
# affected player can't choose to do so" (CR 121.2b) - whether or not they have drawn yet this turn. Before the Spirit
# arrives, Bot2's turn 2 draw triggers Bot1's Sphinx and Bot1 is asked, and draws two. Bot1 casts the Spirit on turn 3; Bot2's
# turn 4 draw triggers the Sphinx again, and Bot1, who has drawn nothing in Bot2's turn, is not asked whether to draw two:
# nothing is drawn.

